# Local throwaway Postgres for the server suites.
#
# It normally lives outside the repo, at %LOCALAPPDATA%\360-peoplehub-pg — it used
# to sit under AppData\Local\Temp, which Windows cleanup purged mid-session and
# destroyed. These entries are a guard for anyone who points it at the working
# tree instead: a cluster's data directory must never be stageable.
.data/
pgtest/
